SH32F284:
- Cortex-M3
- Up to 84MHz
- Flash Size:128KB, SRAM:8KB, CRAM:16KB, EEPROM:6KB, OTP:2KB
- 2 x ADC(8CHs), 1 x MACP, 1 x MCM, 3 x GPT, 1 x QEI 
- 3 x OP, 3 x CMP
- 4 x Timer, 3 x UART, 1 x SPI, 1 x TWI, 16 x EXTI, 1 x CRC
- 8 channel DMA     
- Up to 58 GPIOs      
